    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the er is so expensive and i'm really scared to take him there if it's not super serious. he's still breathing okay and just seems really tired. honestly, couldn't i just try some Pedialyte or even some diluted juice first to see if he perks up? i don't want to be overreacting if it's just a little stomach bug.",
